            <ArticleTitle>Repeated digital nerve block for pain control after tenolysis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>257-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a way of achieving immediate painfree mobilisation after tenolysis or tenosynovectomy in Zone II. Bupivacaine is instilled along the flexor tendon sheath through a thin percutaneous catheter with an antibacterial filter.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
